* {{m|hi|रंग-क्षेत्र|tr=raṅg-kṣētra||stage}}
* {{m|hi|रंगभूमि|tr=raṅg-bhūmi||theater, arena}}
* {{m|hi|रंगीला|tr=raṅgīlā||colorful, gay}}, also {{m|hi|रंगीन|tr=raṅgīn}}

